Most files here are pristine verbatim copies. The following were deliberately adapted
(human policy: when the committed golden is stale vs the current upstream source, adapt
the fixture). These are NO LONGER byte-identical to the committed upstream .rc — they are
source-derived adaptations. Tracked explicitly so it stays transparent which fixtures are
pristine and which are adapted.

  c_flow.rc — FLOW op (240 / 0xF0) was stale at 5 fields (RowLayout shape) while the current
    ./androidx FlowLayout.apply/read encode 7 fields. Adapted: spliced 2 int fields
    (maxItemsInEachRow, maxLines) immediately after the spacedBy float at FLOW-opcode-offset+21.
    Both defaults = Integer.MAX_VALUE (0x7FFFFFFF), source-derived from FlowLayout. Doc length +8
    (1037 -> 1045 bytes). FLOW op region: F0 | compId | animId | hPos | vPos | spacedBy |
    7FFFFFFF | 7FFFFFFF | <next op 0x10>. Spec by assist (source-derived).
    Verification: codec decode->re-encode byte-identical against dev-2's FLOW-7 impl (REM-24 e67320a)
    on iOS K/N (ConformanceEngine.roundTrip) — CONFIRMED.

